139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The mobility of researchers is a key driver of excellence in research. However, researchers face difficulties and are often reluctant to accept postings in a foreign country fearing from losing their pension contributions or even not being eligible for these during short-term contracts due to vesting periods. To overcome this problem, the European Commission has supported the creation of a single European-wide pension fund called RESAVER \(Retirement Savings Vehicle for European Research Institutions\), tailor-made for research organisations and their employees.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
